<title>BRAZIL: BRAZIL PUBLISHES LIST OF LARGEST 500 CORPORATIONS.</title>
<headline>BRAZIL PUBLISHES LIST OF LARGEST 500 CORPORATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's independent research institute Getulio Vargas Foundation (FGV) has published a list of the country's largest 500 corporations.</p>
<p>The ranking was drawn up on the basis of total assets and net operational revenue of each company. The companies' financial performance was not a criteria.</p>
<p>The 1996 non-inflation adjusted results of 3,950 corporations were surveyed between January 1 and May 30, 1997 to draw up the ranking, which has been published annually for the past 25 years.</p>
<p>The following are the top 50 companies in order of rank.</p>
<p>1.  Petrobras SA</p>
<p>2.  Furnas Centrais Electricas SA</p>
<p>3.  Telesp SA</p>
<p>4.  Eletropaulo SA</p>
<p>5.  Cesp SA</p>
